--- !u!114 &114559176915787301
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1977035014860488}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 297
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 你借阅的副本看完后，自行毁去便可。切记，无论你从藏经阁内拿的是天阶的神通玉简，还是最普通的人阶秘籍，都绝不可以外传！
  description:
  AvatarIDSetType: 1
  AvatarID: {fileID: 114966137213933724}
  AvatarIntID: 0
  character: {fileID: 0}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
  fadeWhenDone: 1
  waitForClick: 1
  stopVoiceover: 1
  waitForVO: 0
  setSayDialog: {fileID: 0}
--- !u!114 &114668099933862573
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1977035014860488}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 291
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 我派藏经阁共分三层，这第一层存放的都是一些普通的功法、神通以及一些修真界的基础知识，是专门给低阶修士准备的，因为要普及众多的弟子，所以是不会用玉简存放的。
  description:
  AvatarIDSetType: 1
  AvatarID: {fileID: 114966137213933724}
  AvatarIntID: 0
  character: {fileID: 0}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
  fadeWhenDone: 1
  waitForClick: 1
  stopVoiceover: 1
  waitForVO: 0
  setSayDialog: {fileID: 0}
--- !u!114 &114055213840948828
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1977035014860488}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 296
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 这些书都有很多的副本，但毕竟外门弟子众多，所以我们会收取一些灵石。你若是选好了自己想要的书籍，便可拿来我处登记。
  description:
  AvatarIDSetType: 1
  AvatarID: {fileID: 114966137213933724}
